WEBVTT

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:01.112
in bigger arenas.

00:02:01.112 --> 00:02:03.783
Take the way we fight our wars.

00:02:03.783 --> 00:02:06.850
Did you know that, in Iraq and Afghanistan,

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:10.895
there were more private military contractors on the ground

00:02:10.895 --> 00:02:14.715
than there were U.S. military troops?

00:02:14.715 --> 00:02:17.834
Now this isn't because we had a public debate

00:02:17.834 --> 00:02:20.811
about whether we wanted to outsource war

00:02:20.811 --> 00:02:22.982
to private companies,

00:02:22.982 --> 00:02:25.689
but this is what has happened.

00:02:25.689 --> 00:02:28.117
Over the past three decades,

00:02:28.117 --> 00:02:32.215
we have lived through a quiet revolution.